# Source-based full boundary; no collector, runtime correspondence or controls qualified.
direction: down
classes: {
  start: {style: {fill: "#25364B"; font-color: "#FFFFFF"; bold: true; stroke-width: 3}}
}
Start: "Start here · Independent inventory\nPinned BSD / Mach / RPC / API" {class: start}
Required: "C1–C8 + all unclassified rows\nPaths / fd / VM / IPC / effects"
Approval: "Externally accept whole inputs\nCurrent correspondence = U1"
Boundary: "Observe or contain before release\nInherited state + causal proxies"
Controls: "Calibrate every applicable route\nDirect / child / inherited / proxy"
Loss: "Detect per-class loss and gaps\nReady / association / filters\nDrop / attach / termination"
Unavailable: "U1–U6 remain unavailable\nNo full unprivileged mechanism"
Owners: "K281 human decision → k282 repair + whole review\nThen k269 owners before actual credit\nRequalification / audit / distinct close"
Pure: "Useful authored pure work\nNo adapter or contact credit\nTarget pass unused"
Decision: "Actual contact-limit / lookup choice required\nFull guarantee / stated limit / concrete stronger route\nNo new choice or privilege selected here"
Start -> Required: "1 · no reachable-only set"
Required -> Approval: "2 · independent review"
Approval -> Boundary: "3 · identities + coverage"
Boundary -> Controls: "4 · scratch subjects only"
Controls -> Loss: "5 · each class / variant"
Loss -> Unavailable: "6 · evidence absent"
Unavailable -> Decision: "7 · concrete human decision before consumer"
Decision -> Owners: "8 · apply actual answer + whole review"
Owners -> Pure: "9 · retain useful scope"
